  "details": "- CVE-2026-58415: mod_dav_fs: deny every request for the .DAV state directory\n  from a fixup hook, so the default handler can no longer serve the lock and\n  property databases to GET requests (information disclosure)\n- CVE-2026-59797: mod_ssl: restrict the file() and filesize() functions in\n  SSLRequire expressions read from .htaccess files (improper privilege\n  management)\n- CVE-2026-63045: mod_proxy_ftp: reject a PASV reply whose address differs\n  from the FTP server of the control connection (FTP bounce)\n- CVE-2026-79768: mod_userdir: fix the check rejecting \".\" and \"..\" as user\n  names, which tested the wrong characters (information disclosure)\n- CVE-2026-42356: do not pass the trusted content type of a request on to its\n  internal redirect in ap_internal_redirect_handler(), so the redirect target\n  is not run as CGI (limited remote code execution)",
